{"starts": [0.0, 5.700874000000001, 10.95179, 15.123123, 19.169497, 23.204496, 29.405412, 35.451745], "total": 42.617203, "segs": [{"text": "¿Qué pasa si desaparecen todas las abejas? Spoiler: tu supermercado se vacía.", "words": [["Qué", 0.095458, 0.220458], ["pasa", 0.231833, 0.493208], ["si", 0.504541, 0.629541], ["desaparecen", 0.640916, 1.311374], ["todas", 1.322708, 1.663624], ["las", 1.675, 1.811375], ["abejas", 1.822708, 2.345416], ["Spoiler", 3.125, 3.693166], ["tu", 3.943166, 4.045457], ["supermercado", 4.056833, 4.761374], ["se", 4.772708, 4.886333], ["vacía", 4.897708, 5.340874]], "dur": 5.660874000000001}, {"text": "Las abejas y otros polinizadores ayudan a producir cerca de un tercio de los cultivos del mundo.", "words": [["Las", 0.095458, 0.311374], ["abejas", 0.322708, 0.709083], ["y", 0.720458, 0.799999], ["otros", 0.811375, 1.084083], ["polinizadores", 1.095458, 1.822749], ["ayudan", 1.834083, 2.186374], ["a", 2.197708, 2.243166], ["producir", 2.254541, 2.709082], ["cerca", 2.720458, 3.049999], ["de", 3.061375, 3.175], ["un", 3.186375, 3.32275], ["tercio", 3.334083, 3.674999], ["de", 3.686375, 3.765916], ["los", 3.777291, 3.913666], ["cultivos", 3.925, 4.379541], ["del", 4.390916, 4.504541], ["mundo", 4.515916, 4.890916]], "dur": 5.210916}, {"text": "Primero desaparecerían las almendras, las manzanas y los arándanos.", "words": [["Primero", 0.095458, 0.436374], ["desaparecerían", 0.447708, 1.209083], ["las", 1.220458, 1.356833], ["almendras", 1.368166, 1.947707], ["las", 2.163625, 2.334083], ["manzanas", 2.345458, 2.913624], ["y", 2.925, 2.981833], ["los", 2.993166, 3.152249], ["arándanos", 3.163625, 3.811333]], "dur": 4.131333}, {"text": "Los precios se dispararían y en las tiendas faltarían frutas y verduras.", "words": [["Los", 0.095458, 0.288624], ["precios", 0.3, 0.606833], ["se", 0.618166, 0.697707], ["dispararían", 0.709083, 1.345458], ["y", 1.356833, 1.447749], ["en", 1.459083, 1.538624], ["las", 1.55, 1.697708], ["tiendas", 1.709083, 2.049999], ["faltarían", 2.061375, 2.606833], ["frutas", 2.618166, 3.015874], ["y", 3.027291, 3.072749], ["verduras", 3.084083, 3.686374]], "dur": 4.006374}, {"text": "Otros insectos y el viento ayudarían un poco, pero no alcanzarían.", "words": [["Otros", 0.095458, 0.413624], ["insectos", 0.425, 0.947708], ["y", 0.959083, 1.015916], ["el", 1.027291, 1.106832], ["viento", 1.118166, 1.379541], ["ayudarían", 1.390916, 1.879541], ["un", 1.890916, 2.004541], ["poco", 2.015916, 2.356832], ["pero", 2.595458, 2.777291], ["no", 2.788625, 2.947708], ["alcanzarían", 2.959083, 3.674999]], "dur": 3.994999}, {"text": "Y no, no moriríamos todos en cuatro años. Esa frase que se atribuye a Einstein es un mito.", "words": [["Y", 0.095458, 0.220458], ["no", 0.231833, 0.459124], ["no", 0.743166, 0.856791], ["moriríamos", 0.868166, 1.470457], ["todos", 1.481833, 1.799999], ["en", 1.811375, 1.913666], ["cuatro", 1.925, 2.243166], ["años", 2.254541, 2.663624], ["Esa", 3.443166, 3.693166], ["frase", 3.704541, 3.999999], ["que", 4.011375, 4.102291], ["se", 4.113625, 4.204541], ["atribuye", 4.215916, 4.659082], ["a", 4.670458, 4.761374], ["Einstein", 4.772708, 5.249999], ["es", 5.261375, 5.386375], ["un", 5.397708, 5.488624], ["mito", 5.5, 5.840916]], "dur": 6.160916}, {"text": "Pero comeríamos muy distinto: más trigo y arroz, que no dependen de las abejas, y mucha menos fruta.", "words": [["Pero", 0.095458, 0.288624], ["comeríamos", 0.3, 0.856833], ["muy", 0.868166, 1.015874], ["distinto", 1.027291, 1.527291], ["más", 1.777291, 1.981832], ["trigo", 1.993166, 2.277249], ["y", 2.288625, 2.368166], ["arroz", 2.379541, 2.743166], ["que", 2.981833, 3.084124], ["no", 3.095458, 3.231833], ["dependen", 3.243166, 3.686332], ["de", 3.697708, 3.777249], ["las", 3.788625, 3.936333], ["abejas", 3.947708, 4.390874], ["y", 4.584083, 4.652249], ["mucha", 4.663625, 4.981791], ["menos", 4.993166, 5.311332], ["fruta", 5.322708, 5.686333]], "dur": 6.006333000000001}, {"text": "¿Parte dos? ¿Qué pasa si no duermes d